module kernel::m6;

// Mode 31 is the bounded M7B-1 mechanism gate.  It instantiates one pinned
// provider ELF twice in distinct native processes/CSpaces/address spaces,
// withdraws provider A at an exact #UD boundary, proves A's client capability
// stale, and only then publishes/activates provider B.  This is one immutable
// local LogicalRead, not general 9P, remote transport, consensus, or a foreign
// kernel/personality claim.

